trait-name-ReclamationAmputatedLeftArm = Amputated left arm
trait-description-ReclamationAmputatedLeftArm = You begin with your left arm amputated, including its hand. The amputation is healed. You cannot use that hand.

trait-name-ReclamationAmputatedRightArm = Amputated right arm
trait-description-ReclamationAmputatedRightArm = You begin with your right arm amputated, including its hand. The amputation is healed. You cannot use that hand.

trait-name-ReclamationAmputatedLeftLeg = Amputated left leg
trait-description-ReclamationAmputatedLeftLeg = You begin with your left leg amputated, including its foot. The amputation is healed. Hold a cane to walk with your remaining leg.

trait-name-ReclamationAmputatedRightLeg = Amputated right leg
trait-description-ReclamationAmputatedRightLeg = You begin with your right leg amputated, including its foot. The amputation is healed. Hold a cane to walk with your remaining leg.
